              "numbering": "(x)",
              "text": "(x) Array Transition Assistance; Return of Ono Confidential Information. Upon expiration or termination of this Agreement for any reason, Array shall (A) at Ono's request, provide reasonable transition assistance to Ono for a period of up to six (6) months, including continuing to supply Materials on the terms of Article IX for so long as Ono is required to distribute the Product under Section 14.2(a)(ii); (B) within thirty (30) days after Ono's written request, return to Ono, in a commonly used, machine-readable format, all Data and other Confidential Information of Ono in Array's possession or control (other than Data and Ono Know-How that Array is licensed or otherwise entitled to use pursuant to Section 14.2(a)(iii), (v) or (ix)); and (C) thereafter delete or destroy all remaining copies of such Confidential Information of Ono in its systems and certify such deletion or destruction to Ono in writing, subject to Array's right to keep one (1) copy for archiving purposes."
